flowchart TD
 A[Identify discrepancy or disagreement] --> B{Immediate safety or fatigue risk?}
 B -- Yes --> C[Apply immediate safe roster controls and notify responsible manager]
 B -- No --> D[Document evidence, proposed allocations and concerns]
 C --> D
 D --> E{Industrial or contractual uncertainty?}
 E -- Yes --> F[Obtain medical workforce and HR/IR advice]
 E -- No --> G[Clinical Director and officer negotiate revisions]
 F --> G
 G --> H{Resolved within lawful authority?}
 H -- Yes --> I[Revise job plan and submit for approval]
 H -- No --> J[Escalate to appropriate delegated executive and formal dispute pathway]
 J --> K{Resolution approved?}
 K -- Yes --> I
 K -- No --> L[Record interim safe arrangement and continue applicable dispute process]
 I --> M[Notify officer, implement and monitor]
